 Kotoba Cloud", "Security services — Kotoba Cloud" "보안 서비스 — Kotoba Cloud", "Strictly prohibited" "Strictly prohibited", "Surrounding projects" "주변 프로젝트", "The Database & Ontology workbench on the kotoba.cloud home page visualizes and analyzes observed attributes and types over immutable IPLD snapshots." "kotoba.cloud 홈페이지의 '데이터베이스·온톨로지 관리' 워크벤치를 사용하면 불변 IPLD 스냅숏 상에서 observed attribute와 타입을 시각화하고 분석할 수 있습니다.", "The evidence each rung requires and the daily token allowance it unlocks. The card rung opens the free research allowance; identity and governance checks raise the ceiling after it." "각 단계에서 요구되는 Evidence와 그에 따라 해제되는 일일 토큰 Allowance입니다. 카드 등록(레벨 1) 단계에서 무료 연구 할당량이 열리고, 이후 본인 확인·거버넌스 확인(레벨 2 이상)을 거치면 상한이 올라갑니다.", "The former kotobase.net now integrates its operation surface (graph) and documentation surface (docs) under kotoba.cloud paths. Operations: " "기존 kotobase.net은 운영 화면(graph)과 문서 화면(docs)을 kotoba.cloud 경로로 통합했습니다. 운영은 ", "The research API's models, the free allowance and the conditions of admission." "연구용 API에서 선택할 수 있는 모델, 무료 할당량, 이용 조건입니다.", "URI design" "URI 설계", "Usage guide for the Kotoba Cloud Database (formerly the Kotobase graph plane) Graph & Ontology workbench, plus reference material for the surrounding projects (ayatori, capability-bench)." "Kotoba Cloud Database(구 Kotobase graph plane)의 Graph & Ontology 워크벤치 사용 가이드와 함께, 주변 프로젝트(ayatori, capability-bench)에 대한 참고 자료를 정리한 페이지입니다.", "benchmarks comparing OrbitDB / Ceramic / ActorDB / Holochain against kotobase's own Prolly Tree + commit DAG shape under one capability contract and datom workload. Results and methodology: " "OrbitDB / Ceramic / ActorDB / Holochain과 kotobase 고유의 Prolly Tree + commit DAG 구조를 동일한 capability contract와 datom workload로 비교한 벤치마크입니다. 결과와 방법론은 ", "ceiling " "상한 ", "kotoba.cloud verifies identity through Stripe Identity (verify.stripe.com) only. Documents and the face image go to Stripe alone; kotoba.cloud keeps the verification status, its expiry and evidence references." "kotoba.cloud의 본인 확인은 Stripe Identity(verify.stripe.com)를 통해서만 이루어집니다. 서류와 얼굴 이미지는 Stripe에만 전송되며, kotoba.cloud는 본인 확인 상태, 만료일, 증빙 참조 정보만 보관합니다.", "the recipient decryptor that consumes the kotobase.disclosure-grant protocol (via the :decrypt-fn seam). Contract and rollout gates: " "kotobase.disclosure-grant 프로토콜(:decrypt-fn seam을 통해)을 소비하는 recipient decryptor. Contract와 rollout gate는 "}, :mr {" ; documentation: this " " ; दस्तऐवजीकरण: हे ", " page. The graph.kotoba.cloud subdomain is not provisioned, to keep one canonical origin." " पानावर. एकच canonical origin राखण्यासाठी graph.kotoba.cloud सबडोमेन उपलब्ध केलेला नाही.", "A first-party console (browser capture, operator review) is maintained as a tested component but is not published or accepting requests today." "एक first-party कन्सोल (ब्राउझर कॅप्चर, ऑपरेटर पुनरावलोकन) चाचणी केलेला घटक म्हणून राखला जातो, परंतु सध्या तो प्रकाशित नाही किंवा विनंत्या स्वीकारत नाही.", "Acceptable Use Policy - Security Research - Kotoba Cloud" "Acceptable Use Policy - Security Research - Kotoba Cloud", "Account — Kotoba Cloud" "खाते — Kotoba Cloud", "Allowance: " "Allowance: ", "Allowed uses" "अनुमत वापर", "Apps" "अॅप्स", "Assurance ladder" "Assurance ladder", "Billing & plans" "बिलिंग आणि योजना", "Billing — Kotoba Cloud" "बिलिंग — Kotoba Cloud", "Graph & Ontology database — documentation" "Graph व Ontology डेटाबेस — दस्तऐवजीकरण", "Home" "मुख्यपृष्ठ", "Identity verification runs through Stripe Identity only" "ओळख पडताळणी केवळ Stripe Identity मार्गे होते", "Identity verification — Kotoba Cloud" "ओळख पडताळणी — Kotoba Cloud", "Local execution boundary" "स्थानिक अंमलबजावणी सीमा", "Models — Kotoba Cloud" "मॉडेल्स — Kotoba Cloud", "New apps land here as cards — the sidebar never grows." "नवीन अॅप्स इथे कार्ड्स म्हणून येतात — साइडबार कधीही वाढत नाही.", "Offensive capability, on conditions" "आक्रमक क्षमता, अटींसह", "Open the graph workbench" "ग्राफ वर्कबेंच उघडा", "Open the workbench (home page)" "वर्कबेंच उघडा (मुख्यपृष्ठ)", "Privacy" "गोपन