ng opens the free research allowance; identity and governance checks raise the ceiling after it." "各等级所需的凭证（evidence）以及解锁的每日 token 额度。绑定信用卡（第 1 级）即可开启免费研究额度；此后通过身份验证与治理审核（第 2 级起）可提升上限。", "The former kotobase.net now integrates its operation surface (graph) and documentation surface (docs) under kotoba.cloud paths. Operations: " "原 kotobase.net 现已将操作面（graph）与文档面（docs）整合到 kotoba.cloud 的路径下。操作入口：", "The research API's models, the free allowance and the conditions of admission." "研究 API 可选的模型、免费额度以及准入条件。", "URI design" "URI 设计", "Usage guide for the Kotoba Cloud Database (formerly the Kotobase graph plane) Graph & Ontology workbench, plus reference material for the surrounding projects (ayatori, capability-bench)." "本页汇总了 Kotoba Cloud Database（原 Kotobase graph 平面）Graph & Ontology 工作台的使用说明，以及周边项目（ayatori、capability-bench）的参考资料。", "benchmarks comparing OrbitDB / Ceramic / ActorDB / Holochain against kotobase's own Prolly Tree + commit DAG shape under one capability contract and datom workload. Results and methodology: " "在同一 capability contract 与 datom workload 下，比较 OrbitDB / Ceramic / ActorDB / Holochain 与 kotobase 自有 Prolly Tree + commit DAG 结构的基准测试。结果与方法见 ", "ceiling " "上限 ", "kotoba.cloud verifies identity through Stripe Identity (verify.stripe.com) only. Documents and the face image go to Stripe alone; kotoba.cloud keeps the verification status, its expiry and evidence references." "kotoba.cloud 的身份验证仅通过 Stripe Identity（verify.stripe.com）进行。证件与人脸图像只发送至 Stripe；kotoba.cloud 仅保留验证状态、有效期及证据引用。", "the recipient decryptor that consumes the kotobase.disclosure-grant protocol (via the :decrypt-fn seam). Contract and rollout gates: " "消费 kotobase.disclosure-grant 协议（通过 :decrypt-fn seam）的 recipient decryptor。Contract 与 rollout gate 为 "}})
